5. External prelude
-------------------
The standing `prelude.maude` is not shipped in this repository. Obtain it from
a Maude install and point `$MAUDE_LIB` at that directory (in addition to
share/maude-gpl and share/tnk when using the bundled companion libs).

6. Implementation lineage
-------------------------
Tambanokano's initial implementation was informed by source-level comparison
and differential testing against Maude 3.5.1. That work covered the official
Maude source areas `src/Core`, `src/Interface`, `src/FreeTheory`,
`src/ACU_Theory`, `src/AU_Theory`, `src/CUI_Theory`, `src/Higher`,
`src/Mixfix`, `src/StrategyLanguage`, `src/Meta`, `src/Temporal`, and
`src/Utility`, plus `src/Main/prelude.maude`.

This release-level record replaces machine-local checkout paths and unstable
line-number citations in implementation and fixture comments. It records
historical lineage, not an ongoing compatibility target or semantic authority.
License classification remains as stated in sections 1 through 4 above.
